WEBVTT

00:01.320 --> 00:02.720
It's hard to say

00:03.400 --> 00:04.600
What if Father

00:04.680 --> 00:05.400
Really has

00:05.480 --> 00:06.880
A share in it?

00:10.360 --> 00:11.040
You're saying

00:11.120 --> 00:12.200
The Chen family embezzled

00:12.280 --> 00:13.680
And I also embezzled?

00:15.160 --> 00:16.040
Enough

00:16.120 --> 00:18.120
To have a son like you

00:18.680 --> 00:21.120
Counts as me repaying heaven's favor

00:21.680 --> 00:22.520
Get out

00:22.600 --> 00:23.400
Get out

00:23.480 --> 00:23.800
Father

00:23.960 --> 00:24.080
I

00:24.160 --> 00:26.493
I don't want to see you again

00:30.680 --> 00:31.880
Yes

00:33.000 --> 00:43.000
In the 18th year of Yuankang, Prince of Jin Sikong Yao fell from imperial favor over the Chu Huan treason case and was exiled to the south. En route, his vessel mysteriously sprang a leak and capsized in the river.

